WEBVTT

00:05:27.465 --> 00:05:30.226
We're really concerned
with kids naught to five.

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:31.470
And why?

00:05:31.946 --> 00:05:36.747
Washing is the antidote
to the sort of bugs,

00:05:36.771 --> 00:05:39.994
the common infectious diseases
of the eyes, the ears,

00:05:40.018 --> 00:05:42.414
the chest and the skin

00:05:42.438 --> 00:05:45.310
that, if they occur in the first
five years of life,

00:05:45.334 --> 00:05:48.737
permanently damage those organs.

00:05:49.515 --> 00:05:52.194
They leave a lifelong remnant.

00:05:53.123 --> 00:05:55.225
That means that by the age of five,

00:05:55.249 --> 00:05:57.535
you can't see as well
for the rest of your life.

00:05:57.559 --> 00:06:00.049
You can't hear as well
for the rest of your life.